{"availability":"available","full":"Maiz27/follow-sync","name":"follow-sync","description":"Your intelligent GitHub network manager. Gain clear insights into your followers and following, identify non-mutual connections, and efficiently organize your professional GitHub presence.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2025-07-26T14:04:34Z","updated":"2026-10-08T15:54:26Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://follow-sync.vercel.app","topics":["github","github-follower-analyzer","graphql","nextjs","react-query"],"demo":"https://follow-sync.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:46.723Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:46.723Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:46.723Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:46.723Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":[],"features":["Comprehensive Network Analysis: Get a clear picture of who you follow that doesn't follow you back, and vice-versa.","Ghost Account Detection & Removal: Identify \"ghost\" connections—deleted or suspended accounts that still linger in your following list. Ghosts are detected for free by diffing GitHub's GraphQL following list (which…","Organization Awareness: Organizations you follow are surfaced with a badge and excluded from non-mutual analysis (they can't follow you back). GitHub's GraphQL API omits organizations entirely, so they are recovered…","Single-Click Follow/Unfollow: Manage your network directly from the Follow Sync interface with optimistic UI updates for a seamless experience.","Adaptive Caching: Utilizes your own GitHub Gists as a database, with an intelligent caching mechanism to respect GitHub's API rate limits while keeping your data fresh."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Maiz27/follow-sync/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"46b3174834646f00942118e216295d2a189d3e5c6fe4aaba9cbcabf8045afabf","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:46.855Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:46.855Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":null,"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Search, Sort & Export: Filter every list by login or name, sort by followers/following/name, and export the current view as CSV (spreadsheet-safe) or JSON.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Maiz27/follow-sync/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Your network cache lives in a secret gist in your own GitHub account (keyed by your login); signing out clears the app's account-scoped browser storage.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Maiz27/follow-sync/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"46b3174834646f00942118e216295d2a189d3e5c6fe4aaba9cbcabf8045afabf","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Maiz27/follow-sync/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:46.856Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T15:54:26Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Maiz27/follow-sync/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:46.856Z","hash":"46b3174834646f00942118e216295d2a189d3e5c6fe4aaba9cbcabf8045afabf","originalBytes":8095,"storedBytes":8095,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["github","follow","pnpm","network","sync","app","graphql","phase","data","gist","rest","secret","settings","accounts","cache","client","oauth","project","api","unfollow","vercel","auth","authentication","caching","following","list","never","organizations","start","them","url","access","account","actions","analysis","application","back","browser","build","click","connections","create","dev","env.local","every","file","followers","format","ghost","install","license","lists","name","own","page","pat","private","production","public","query","run","server-side","stored","they","token","under","user","which","adaptive","after","against","app.","architecture","bash","bulk","chunk","codegen","configure","configured","confirmation","dependencies","development","dismissible","